    "created_at": "2019-06-03T13:25:55Z",
    "updated_at": "2019-06-03T13:25:55Z",
    "body": "So having looked at the PR I'm a little confused by this request as the document CSS pixels links to https://drafts.csswg.org/css-values/ does not use or define \"unrounded\". And unless otherwise stated everything in standards is usually precise up to implementation-defined limits.\r\n\r\nIs there some kind of precedent here we should follow or some particular concern that prompted this question?",
    "author_association": "MEMBER",
    "pin": null,
