    "created_at": "2019-06-05T08:01:46Z",
    "updated_at": "2019-06-05T08:01:46Z",
    "body": "That would make sense to me if that were the practice in CSS and CSS defined \"unrounded\" and what it would mean for CSS pixels. That is, I don't think this is something HTML could adopt on its own. It would have to be a universal practice to convey meaning and not end up being confusing.",
